      <p begin="01:32.670" end="01:36.160" ttm:agent="v1">Should tell my boyfriend, what I been doin'</p>
      <p begin="01:36.160" end="01:39.840" ttm:agent="v1">Been thinking of you, every time I screw him</p>
      <p begin="01:39.840" end="01:43.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And if you want me, you gotta put the word in (uh-huh)</p>
      <p begin="01:43.360" end="01:46.710" ttm:agent="v1">Go tell your girlfriend, that I'm your girlfriend</p>
